{"2124150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skirmish Mayhem", "steam_appid": 2124150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skirmish Mayhem is an action strategy game where you upgrade your arsenal, construct a base and build an army to defend against waves of enemies. Unlock more maps, commanders, weapons, units and buildings as you conquer the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/9e03705bc195f3461499249304ec02ac.webp?t=1769271166\" width=615 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle as the bio-science obsessed <strong>Virid</strong>, Conquer as the holy order of <strong>Sanctul</strong> or sew chaos as the demonic legion of <strong>Matulis</strong>. Each faction comes with their own unique commanders, units, buildings, weapons and passives with focuses on different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/ecc9e0ce16f26a8c61c073d100333545.poster.avif?t=1769271166\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/ecc9e0ce16f26a8c61c073d100333545.webm?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/ecc9e0ce16f26a8c61c073d100333545.mp4?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/185dc1d79a94526cb2c8d5c282f83e13.webp?t=1769271166\" width=615 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy your many enemies alone or fight alongside your own forces. Defend not only yourself, but your buildings so you can gain the advantage on the unrelenting waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/38763d546221d486e88f8efce7cc8b41.poster.avif?t=1769271166\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/38763d546221d486e88f8efce7cc8b41.webm?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/38763d546221d486e88f8efce7cc8b41.mp4?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/63d5e9a3638ab4bccc682b60053bbc5c.webp?t=1769271166\" width=615 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your commander with a multitude of weapons such as snipers, shotguns, lasers, shields and grow stronger over the course of a battle. Then outside of the battlefield upgrade a faction's tech tree increasing the stats of that faction and unlocking stronger weapons, buildings and units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/76b89a42577999ec20f97e0fe8572c7c.poster.avif?t=1769271166\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/76b89a42577999ec20f97e0fe8572c7c.webm?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/76b89a42577999ec20f97e0fe8572c7c.mp4?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/b5915c7c695e3d8ebfb5e769d94826c5.webp?t=1769271166\" width=615 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with the unique enemy units on each level requiring different strategies to defeat, each world has multiple bosses for you to conquer; these range from giant alien mutants to enormous machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/aa356a77c5ac946184318e4b301fe98f.poster.avif?t=1769271166\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/aa356a77c5ac946184318e4b301fe98f.webm?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/aa356a77c5ac946184318e4b301fe98f.mp4?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/bb165dd7701deea8afc6d9a8f1d53bb4.webp?t=1769271166\" width=615 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play you unlock new maps to fight on, new weapons, passives, commanders and new difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/8809d793484da4a4dfc6341e74a0da22.poster.avif?t=1769271166\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/8809d793484da4a4dfc6341e74a0da22.webm?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/8809d793484da4a4dfc6341e74a0da22.mp4?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skirmish Mayhem is an action strategy game where you upgrade your arsenal, construct a base and build an army to defend against waves of enemies. Unlock more maps, commanders, weapons, units and buildings as you conquer the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/9e03705bc195f3461499249304ec02ac.webp?t=1769271166\" width=615 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle as the bio-science obsessed <strong>Virid</strong>, Conquer as the holy order of <strong>Sanctul</strong> or sew chaos as the demonic legion of <strong>Matulis</strong>. Each faction comes with their own unique commanders, units, buildings, weapons and passives with focuses on different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/ecc9e0ce16f26a8c61c073d100333545.poster.avif?t=1769271166\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/ecc9e0ce16f26a8c61c073d100333545.webm?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/ecc9e0ce16f26a8c61c073d100333545.mp4?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/185dc1d79a94526cb2c8d5c282f83e13.webp?t=1769271166\" width=615 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy your many enemies alone or fight alongside your own forces. Defend not only yourself, but your buildings so you can gain the advantage on the unrelenting waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/38763d546221d486e88f8efce7cc8b41.poster.avif?t=1769271166\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/38763d546221d486e88f8efce7cc8b41.webm?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/38763d546221d486e88f8efce7cc8b41.mp4?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/63d5e9a3638ab4bccc682b60053bbc5c.webp?t=1769271166\" width=615 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your commander with a multitude of weapons such as snipers, shotguns, lasers, shields and grow stronger over the course of a battle. Then outside of the battlefield upgrade a faction's tech tree increasing the stats of that faction and unlocking stronger weapons, buildings and units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/76b89a42577999ec20f97e0fe8572c7c.poster.avif?t=1769271166\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/76b89a42577999ec20f97e0fe8572c7c.webm?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/76b89a42577999ec20f97e0fe8572c7c.mp4?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/b5915c7c695e3d8ebfb5e769d94826c5.webp?t=1769271166\" width=615 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with the unique enemy units on each level requiring different strategies to defeat, each world has multiple bosses for you to conquer; these range from giant alien mutants to enormous machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/aa356a77c5ac946184318e4b301fe98f.poster.avif?t=1769271166\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/aa356a77c5ac946184318e4b301fe98f.webm?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/aa356a77c5ac946184318e4b301fe98f.mp4?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/bb165dd7701deea8afc6d9a8f1d53bb4.webp?t=1769271166\" width=615 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play you unlock new maps to fight on, new weapons, passives, commanders and new difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/8809d793484da4a4dfc6341e74a0da22.poster.avif?t=1769271166\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/8809d793484da4a4dfc6341e74a0da22.webm?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/extras/8809d793484da4a4dfc6341e74a0da22.mp4?t=1769271166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Defend, Upgrade, and Conquer. A unique hybrid of roguelike action and real-time strategy. Choose your Faction and play as a powerful Commander and battle alongside your army. Fight for your Faction, unlock new Commanders, tech-up, and become an all-powerful force!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/8d5548c5e5899a03afa1afe1e9a06f2adcfcecf6/header.jpg?t=1769271166", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/a1aa3f5b6cc0a9a7c0b56717947cab51f22393db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769271166", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124150/a1aa3f5b6cc0a9a7c0b56717947cab51f22393db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769271166", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 580 / AMD HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>